WEBVTT

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:15.540
My room at home...

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:19.540
That was the last place
I remember being human...

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:41.330
Maybe if I can get home,
I can find a way out of this mess!

00:00:41.880 --> 00:00:43.580
I just gotta get outside!

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:51.630
C'mon, now.

00:00:51.630 --> 00:00:54.250
No scratching at the door, Pochita.

00:00:56.540 --> 00:00:59.210
It's been a few days now...

00:00:59.210 --> 00:01:02.330
I'm thrilled I get to live with
someone I really like,

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:05.670
but I'm missing a chunk of my memory
just before I woke up as a dog.

00:01:06.130 --> 00:01:08.790
How did I end up like this?

00:01:13.380 --> 00:01:15.040
Wanna go outside?

00:01:15.420 --> 00:01:17.630
Wait, is she gonna take me on a date?!

00:01:19.920 --> 00:01:22.670
Wanna go on a walk?

00:01:24.540 --> 00:01:27.080
That collar's seen better days...

00:01:28.250 --> 00:01:35.210
But the cold metal and
Inukai-san's warm hands feel really nice.

00:01:36.630 --> 00:01:38.880
But ow, my neck!

00:01:52.130 --> 00:01:55.790
The tight collar around my neck
shredded my last bit of doubt.

00:01:56.210 --> 00:01:59.580
I really am Inukai-san's dog now.

00:02:00.210 --> 00:02:01.710
You ready?

00:02:05.380 --> 00:02:08.330
Yosomi shinaide onrii wan na good boy

00:02:08.330 --> 00:02:11.500
Kimi to ireba wandafuru ranran raifu

00:02:11.500 --> 00:02:14.580
One, two, three de jump! Aijou atenshon

00:02:14.580 --> 00:02:17.670
Three, two, one de turn! Kitai ijou supaaku

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:20.830
One to one de love! Gyakkyou furakushon

00:02:20.830 --> 00:02:23.920
Asa kara ban made wandafuru ni saabisu

00:02:23.920 --> 00:02:27.040
Daisuki datte tsutawatte little boy

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:30.630
Aishite! Aishite! Aisasete I want you

00:02:31.170 --> 00:02:36.960
Boku o ikiro kanzen nenshou hashirinukero

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:43.630
Gooru wa atarashii jibun sa
(Go Beyond Yourself!)

00:02:43.630 --> 00:02:49.420
Takaku hoero manshinsoui na kinou koete

00:02:49.420 --> 00:02:52.460
Ashita no (aijou atenshon)
bokura no (gyakkyou furakushon)

00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:56.670
Seiippai kagayaiteru

00:02:56.670 --> 00:02:58.170
This is your life, your way!

00:02:58.290 --> 00:02:59.830
This is my life, my way!

00:02:59.960 --> 00:03:00.830
Wan!

00:03:05.790 --> 00:03:09.040
<b>Walkies.</b>

00:03:15.580 --> 00:03:18.920
Everything looks so big from down here!

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:20.330
I'm kinda scared...

00:03:20.330 --> 00:03:21.630
But way more embarrassed!

00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:24.830
I can't believe I'm crawling around
on all fours out in public!

00:03:25.750 --> 00:03:27.000
Look at that cute dog!

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:28.420
Aww!

00:03:29.210 --> 00:03:30.880
And they're all looking at me!

00:03:31.210 --> 00:03:33.330
And with nothing covering my back bits...

00:03:33.330 --> 00:03:35.790
They can see everything!

00:03:42.330 --> 00:03:45.170
Finally, we're somewhere less crowded...

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:54.500
Isn't this fun, Pochita?!

00:03:56.380 --> 00:03:58.540
Wait, now we're running?!

00:04:00.790 --> 00:04:01.790
I can almost see...

00:04:01.790 --> 00:04:03.290
Nope, I totally see!

00:04:03.290 --> 00:04:05.540
London, France, the whole shebang, Inukai-san!

00:04:23.750 --> 00:04:26.630
Ow! I stubbed my nose on something.

00:04:26.880 --> 00:04:28.460
Wait, what's going on?

00:04:28.880 --> 00:04:31.380
Wait, you're under my skirt...

00:04:31.380 --> 00:04:32.380
Huh?

00:04:32.380 --> 00:04:36.130
I gotta get out of here,
but I can't see anything...

00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:38.750
Maybe if I push this outta the way...

00:04:41.170 --> 00:04:44.710
Oh no! My nose is stuck on her undies!

00:04:52.250 --> 00:04:56.500
Bad boy! You know that's not for you.

00:04:59.130 --> 00:05:02.130
But thanks for keeping me safe.

00:05:07.420 --> 00:05:09.920
Huh? Your nose is a little red.

00:05:09.920 --> 00:05:11.790
Did it hit your nose?

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:17.290
Huh?

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:22.920
Dogs lick their boo-boos better, right?

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:25.790
Inu, Inukai-san!

00:05:26.710 --> 00:05:27.920
Um...

00:05:30.880 --> 00:05:33.500
Those must've been the kids who hit the ball.

00:05:33.830 --> 00:05:35.670
We're sorry.

00:05:40.080 --> 00:05:41.210
Are you?

00:05:41.830 --> 00:05:42.830
Holy shit!

00:05:43.630 --> 00:05:46.750
Little dogs come walking through this park.

00:05:46.750 --> 00:05:48.380
Be careful, okay?

00:05:54.420 --> 00:05:56.040
We're really sorry!

00:05:57.500 --> 00:05:58.920
C'mon, run!

00:05:58.920 --> 00:06:01.330
That lady was really mean!

00:06:04.380 --> 00:06:07.460
Guess she only likes dogs, not humans.

00:06:07.460 --> 00:06:10.290
This life might not be half-bad...

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:15.580
Something feels funny down south...

00:06:16.250 --> 00:06:18.210
Oh, crap. Don't tell me...

00:06:20.290 --> 00:06:25.420
Oh my gosh, do you have to pee?!

00:06:36.380 --> 00:06:38.330
You can go right there!

00:06:41.960 --> 00:06:43.210
You're kidding me.

00:06:44.130 --> 00:06:45.130
Outside?

00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:47.710
Right there?

00:06:48.500 --> 00:06:51.130
While Inukai-san's watching?!

00:06:52.790 --> 00:06:54.580
Come on, man!

00:06:56.330 --> 00:06:58.710
I'm not gonna lose my last shred of humanity!

00:06:59.170 --> 00:07:03.380
I'm not gonna take a leak
right in front of the girl I like!

00:07:04.170 --> 00:07:06.210
I can hold it in!

00:07:15.920 --> 00:07:20.210
It's so cute how your little leg shakes!

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:26.540
Inu, Inukai-san!

00:07:26.540 --> 00:07:28.460
Why are you taking pictures?!

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:29.500
Stop!

00:07:31.580 --> 00:07:32.710
I swear...

00:07:33.210 --> 00:07:34.920
I swear, dammit!

00:07:35.290 --> 00:07:37.920
I'm gonna be a human again!

00:07:45.540 --> 00:07:47.580
Sure, I had to pee outside...

00:07:47.580 --> 00:07:51.580
But what else was I gonna do?
She had me on a leash.

00:07:52.750 --> 00:07:55.460
I don't know how to get back to my old self.

00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:59.790
But I have to tell Inukai-san
how I feel about her...

00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:07.250
I love you!

00:08:08.540 --> 00:08:10.170
You wanna play?

00:08:12.250 --> 00:08:15.170
I can only say it out loud right now
'cause I know she won't understand.

00:08:15.540 --> 00:08:18.710
We're so close, but so far apart.

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:21.000
Are you hungry?

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:25.040
I'm right here,
but she doesn't know how I feel.

00:08:25.040 --> 00:08:26.500
Being a dog sucks...

00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:29.500
Karen, your friend's here!

00:08:30.580 --> 00:08:32.420
What's up?

00:08:32.420 --> 00:08:33.830
Nekotani?!

00:08:34.170 --> 00:08:36.330
Why is she here?!

00:08:36.710 --> 00:08:37.830
Yo!

00:08:40.250 --> 00:08:43.710
O-okay, let's get to studying!

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:49.630
How is Inukai-san friends with
that gyaru bimbo?

00:08:51.330 --> 00:08:54.500
Sheesh, would it kill you to smile sometime?

00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:56.540
And she's letting her grab her like that?!

00:08:56.540 --> 00:09:00.630
How's it fair you're both pretty and smart?

00:09:00.630 --> 00:09:03.250
You're gonna get held back
if you don't shape up.

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:04.210
They're so close!

00:09:09.710 --> 00:09:13.500
We're going to buckle down on
your least favorite subject: math.

00:09:13.500 --> 00:09:15.290
Let's get to work.

00:09:15.710 --> 00:09:18.210
She's still as stoic as ever...

00:09:18.670 --> 00:09:21.330
What are you, Satan?!

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:24.750
Damn, you're still so cool, though!

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:28.040
Mike Nekotani...

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:31.580
She's not the type of person
I'd ever wanna hang out with,

00:09:31.580 --> 00:09:35.250
so even though she lived
right next to my house,

00:09:35.250 --> 00:09:38.290
we never talked.

00:09:44.380 --> 00:09:46.500
I'm totally lost...

00:09:46.790 --> 00:09:48.080
Hold on.

00:09:48.080 --> 00:09:50.580
If I could somehow go with Nekotani
when she leaves,

00:09:50.580 --> 00:09:53.000
I might be able to get home!

00:09:54.500 --> 00:09:58.330
And home is the last place
I remember being human!

00:09:58.710 --> 00:10:01.580
I'm sure my family's worried about me, too.

00:10:02.920 --> 00:10:06.380
They must think they've gone
and outlived their own son...

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:08.830
That's it!

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:13.460
Aww, your dog is so cute!

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:14.540
I'll get Nekotani to like me...
Aww, your dog is so cute!<b></b>

00:10:14.540 --> 00:10:15.750
I'll get Nekotani to like me...

00:10:15.750 --> 00:10:18.420
I'mma take you home to have some fun!

00:10:18.420 --> 00:10:19.540
Then I'll get her to take me home!
I'mma take you home to have some fun!<b></b>

00:10:19.540 --> 00:10:20.830
Then I'll get her to take me home!

00:10:21.880 --> 00:10:23.380
It's perfect!

00:10:29.630 --> 00:10:31.790
Karen, can I borrow you for a sec?

00:10:36.250 --> 00:10:38.420
Sorry, I'll be back.

00:10:38.750 --> 00:10:41.080
Y-you got it, boss!

00:10:43.210 --> 00:10:45.710
She just handed me
the perfect chance on a platter!

00:10:48.920 --> 00:10:52.710
I've learned a few tricks these past few days...

00:10:52.960 --> 00:10:58.630
Okay! It's time to show Nekotani
how I suck up to Inukai-san!

00:11:02.500 --> 00:11:06.250
Hausu! Hausu! Hausu! Hausu! Hausu! Hausu!

00:11:07.290 --> 00:11:09.880
Hausu! Hausu! Hausu! Hausu!

00:11:09.880 --> 00:11:12.130
Let's go mai hausu!

00:11:12.290 --> 00:11:16.710
Airashii sono sugata ni sukitte sukitte tomaranai

00:11:16.710 --> 00:11:21.880
Watashi ga katte shiawase ni
suru kara kocchi oide yo

00:11:21.880 --> 00:11:26.000
Kyawakyawa chu chu chu himitsu no hitotoki wa

00:11:26.380 --> 00:11:31.040
Suki na mono ni massugu fureaeru daiji na jikan

00:11:31.420 --> 00:11:33.580
Shitawatteru kono kimochi

00:11:33.960 --> 00:11:35.960
Kakushiteta kono kimochi

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:38.330
Mitsuketa kono kimochi

00:11:38.330 --> 00:11:40.000
Todoke! Todoke!

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:42.000
Da-da-da-da-da-da-da daisuki!

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:45.710
Kataomoi kimi ni kitto tsutawarimasu you ni

00:11:45.880 --> 00:11:50.080
Sono shigai kara miageta watashi ga itsuka

00:11:50.080 --> 00:11:52.630
Kimi no numbaa wan ni naritai

00:11:52.630 --> 00:11:55.500
Kokoro no soko kara I love you!
